Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.53,0:00:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use the power of Underworld Circle\Nto bring back my Guardian, Grawl.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.83,0:00:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll activate my\NSoul Charge Magic card,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.31,0:00:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,allowing me to summon even more\Nmonsters from my graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.95,0:00:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Each monster I brought back from\Nthe grave cost me 500 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.35,0:00:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Game over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.25,0:00:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The seal of Orichalcos is powered by the\Ndarkness within the person who plays it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.31,0:00:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Raphael was able to conquer that darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.07,0:00:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.49,0:00:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.65,0:00:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.81,0:00:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it an earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.23,0:00:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's much worse than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.03,0:01:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Y 'all move Y
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.95,0:01:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,'all
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.11,0:01:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,move
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.25,0:01:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.23,0:01:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The building's collapsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.45,0:01:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.23,0:01:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.25,0:01:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.89,0:01:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.95,0:02:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.45,0:02:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,There goes our ride down.\NOh, great. We're stranded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.99,0:02:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.90,0:02:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.87,0:02:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.83,0:02:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.61,0:02:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, follow me. Let's go, dorks, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.73,0:02:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost out, hang in\Nthere. I'll try. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.47,0:02:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, the Pharaoh's still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.65,0:02:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.07,0:02:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta go back for them
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.35,0:02:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to leave now, Mr. Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.09,0:02:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.03,0:03:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.05,0:03:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Raphael, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.07,0:03:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.19,0:03:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't leave without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.45,0:03:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.91,0:03:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll need it if you're\Nplanning to take out darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.97,0:03:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.25,0:03:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoom, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.81,0:03:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.95,0:03:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.15,0:03:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.06,0:03:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.71,0:03:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Take my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.65,0:03:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Go while you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.43,0:03:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Rafael!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.43,0:03:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.23,0:03:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We're right here! Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.41,0:03:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And do it fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.03,0:04:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.85,0:04:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,check it out it's some\Nkind of ancient temple or
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.75,0:04:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,something i guess that's\Nwhat paradia's headquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.79,0:04:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,really looks like i can't\Nsay i'm surprised i think
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.39,0:04:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,there's more to darts that\Nmeets the eye as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.35,0:04:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, have a look at this. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.59,0:04:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of computer chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.93,0:04:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Raphael gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.83,0:04:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.01,0:04:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a map. To where?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.87,0:04:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,To Darts' lair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.19,0:04:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Roland.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.31,0:04:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.22,0:04:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow this map.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.83,0:05:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Right away, sir
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.47,0:05:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got company. Great, does\NDarts have his own air force?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.35,0:05:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he wants us to follow\Nthem Like we have a choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.49,0:05:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.41,0:05:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.15,0:05:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Save for yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.35,0:05:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,On second thought
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.91,0:05:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Step on it, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.47,0:05:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten-four, Beck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.51,0:05:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We're surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.31,0:05:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's time for plan B.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.97,0:05:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.81,0:05:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Freaks, it's go time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.83,0:05:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ancient soldiers of the\NOrecalcos, return to me at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.83,0:06:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, come home, my children.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.17,0:06:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We must prepare for the\Nnext phase of our battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.07,0:06:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.98,0:06:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, it appears they've led us\Nto a government air force base.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.51,0:06:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Just so I'm clear on this,\Nyou're good guys, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.01,0:06:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd like to think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.51,0:06:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, it is our duty to\Nprotect and serve the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.13,0:06:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.04,0:06:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,we tracked you kids down because we need\Nyour help dealing with a worldwide threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.31,0:06:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy as it sounds, we think our\Nonly hope may lie in a card game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.01,0:06:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.17,0:06:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is using the game of\NDuel Monsters to wipe us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.63,0:07:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you understand why we need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.79,0:07:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Who better to stop this menace\Nthan the Duel Monsters experts?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.19,0:07:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.10,0:07:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So if I'm not mistaken, you're\Nasking us to do your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.81,0:07:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact is, we've been following\Ndarts around for months,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.47,0:07:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,but he leaves no evidence behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.47,0:07:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And with no proof, my men\Nand I can't do a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.85,0:07:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, this\Nis no ordinary criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.47,0:07:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And without you, we have\Nnowhere else to turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.81,0:07:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid this is as far\Nas we're permitted to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.97,0:07:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.65,0:07:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.25,0:07:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.53,0:07:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're doing a great service.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.49,0:07:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doing this to save my company.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.31,0:07:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That may be, but if you beat this\Ndarts character in his own game,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.73,0:07:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be saving a lot more\Nthan just your company.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.59,0:07:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Roland, let's move out
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.49,0:08:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't get paid enough for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.93,0:08:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We should have been at his headquarters\Nby now. It's this weather, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.45,0:08:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,we can't see a thing out there\Nbefore the age of atlantis is ushered
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.73,0:08:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,in the mighty sea shall rise and\Nthe skies shall fall only then will
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.39,0:08:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,paradise return just stay calm i'm sure\Ndarts wants us to reach him Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.21,0:08:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.57,0:08:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no turning back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.49,0:08:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.33,0:08:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We've arrived at the heart of evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.03,0:09:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you always have to be so dramatic?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.89,0:09:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, and I thought\NPegasus had a creepy pad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.01,0:09:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm not a big fan\Nof the whole snake motif.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.37,0:09:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.28,0:09:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you wait outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.77,0:09:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, we must all stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.57,0:09:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The five of us are strongest as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.47,0:09:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, what's with all these\Npeople chiseled in stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.17,0:09:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not just any people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.21,0:09:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.12,0:09:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.25,0:09:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There's Mai!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.51,0:09:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And Weevil!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.73,0:09:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be everyone who lost their soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.69,0:09:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.81,0:09:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What a touching reunion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad your friends turned\Nout to be a bunch of stiffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.73,0:09:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Darts!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.51,0:10:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You were expecting someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.03,0:10:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, due to the carelessness of my\Nemployees, I'm the only one left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.69,0:10:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't find good help these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.29,0:10:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I want my company\Nback, so can the small talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.65,0:10:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.89,0:10:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.01,0:10:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We all want something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.95,0:10:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,As for me, I want your souls for my wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.65,0:10:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I even have the spot picked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.01,0:10:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Save it, Darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.21,0:10:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take a lot more than a\Nfew party tricks to scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.53,0:10:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, for the last time,\Nrelease our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.45,0:10:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,that's not possible\Nwhat do you mean i mean
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.71,0:10:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,they've already been put\Nto use as we speak their
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.29,0:10:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,life energy supplies power\Nto the most devastating
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.09,0:10:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,creature that ever lived oh great now what
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.69,0:10:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,my 10 000 year old\Ncollection is almost complete
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.91,0:10:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,once i get you to the\Nbeast can rise hold on
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.79,0:10:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,you've been collecting souls for all those
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.09,0:11:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,years do you know how many\Nlives you've destroyed
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.29,0:11:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Millions, and each one of\Nthem deserve their fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.31,0:11:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a moment and look around, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.51,0:11:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of my favorite conquests\Nare in this very room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.45,0:11:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And since it's taken me ten millennia to\Ncomplete, it's quite the history lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.27,0:11:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.39,0:11:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the outfits on these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.23,0:11:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So some of these people lived in the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.69,0:11:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're catching on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.59,0:11:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since the Great\NLeviathan was laid to rest,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.71,0:11:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been gathering the energy\Nnecessary to fuel its rebirth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.83,0:11:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.03,0:11:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You expect us to believe that junk?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.37,0:11:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ye of little faith, just duel me and I\Npromise I'll make a believer out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.61,0:11:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,For when you lose, there\Nwill be no denying my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.43,0:11:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's stop talking and start dueling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.97,0:11:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't, Kaiba. Not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.49,0:11:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This lunatic is far too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.83,0:12:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So why don't you join him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.85,0:12:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I defeat you, I'll get\Ntwo souls for the price of one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.41,0:12:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Ready, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.69,0:12:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm way ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.47,0:12:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.41,0:12:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll save you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.67,0:12:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words, darts is gonna pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.63,0:12:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, let the games commence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.17,0:12:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.17,0:12:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go first. Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.49,0:12:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate the magic\Ncard, White Dragon Ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.07,0:12:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.55,0:12:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I discard my Force Raider in order\Nto summon Paladin of White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.55,0:13:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, cause here comes the best part!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.81,0:13:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrificed my paladin to bring\Nout my ultimate fighting machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.71,0:13:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, meet Blue-Eyes White Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.03,0:13:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,As much as I'd love to blast you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.75,0:13:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not permitted to attack\Nsince this was my first move,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.15,0:13:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'll let my partner take over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.07,0:13:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mind if I do. Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.35,0:13:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll activate\Nmy Black Luster Ritual,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.25,0:13:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Which lets me sacrifice my\NValkyra, the Magna Warrior,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.01,0:13:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to summon my\NBlack Luster Soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.75,0:13:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That should give you plenty to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.25,0:13:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.93,0:14:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.13,0:14:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Darts better watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.71,0:14:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,They just summoned two Major League\NMonsters on their first turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.41,0:14:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Those pathetic creatures may work\Nin your little card tournaments.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.71,0:14:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid I play a\Ncompletely different game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.11,0:14:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,A game in which the winner takes all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.43,0:14:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And the loser pays the ultimate price.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.91,0:14:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This card was born from\Nthe darkness itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.47,0:14:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold the power that has\Nexisted since the dawn of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.29,0:14:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The very power that shall\Nstrip you of your souls!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.33,0:14:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.31,0:14:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The seal of Orycalcus!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.45,0:14:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, do you feel that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.43,0:15:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you mean the sudden drop in temperature\Nand that freaky evil vibe in the air,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.37,0:15:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,then yes, I do. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.43,0:15:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I've set the tone for\Nthis duel, allow me to continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.11,0:15:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.59,0:15:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Arise, Oricalcos Gaius!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.43,0:15:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I faced this beast before, and it was\Nalmost impossible to destroy, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.87,0:15:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because last time you\Ndidn't have me to bail you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.29,0:15:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll sacrifice\N500 of my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.31,0:15:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That lets me summon my Ori Kalkos Tutora.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.15,0:15:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to the seal, it\Ngets an additional 500 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.89,0:15:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.83,0:15:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that'll do for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.85,0:15:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Then allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.17,0:15:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.35,0:15:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually believed I was up\Nagainst a talented duelist
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.99,0:16:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,until I witnessed your poor\Nexcuse for an opening move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.39,0:16:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You left two weak monsters out\Non the field with no protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.45,0:16:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to this, I'm\Nabout to blow them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.85,0:16:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess you should have thought\Ntwice before challenging me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.91,0:16:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm president of the world's\Nlargest gaming corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.99,0:16:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.25,0:16:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Because no one's mastered the game of duel\Nmonsters like I have, so check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.73,0:16:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I play the magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.83,0:16:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This lets me fuse the two blue eyes in\Nmy hand with the one I have on the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.47,0:16:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Eyes Ultimate Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.71,0:16:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, time to pick\Nup where Kaiba left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.35,0:16:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never withstand the combined\Npower of our dueling decks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.79,0:16:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm about to prove it, darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.03,0:17:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,With this, my polymerization magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.45,0:17:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll use it to fuse Kaiba's\Ndragon with my Black Luster Soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.63,0:17:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,in order to form a new monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.05,0:17:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.96,0:17:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Master of Dragon Soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.09,0:17:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.51,0:17:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,5,000 attack points? Meh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.29,0:17:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about the Dream Team!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.31,0:17:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I reveal my trap card, Me or Rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.79,0:17:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,With this card,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.71,0:17:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll lose the difference\Nbetween my monster's
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.15,0:17:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,attack points and the defense\Npoints of your monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.91,0:17:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If my math is right, that's\Na difference of 3,500!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.65,0:17:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough to leave Dart with Zip!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.19,0:17:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to take you\Ndown and free my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.37,0:17:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Master of Dragon Soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.05,0:17:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack Kizori, Kalkos, Giygas, and wipe\Nout what's left of his life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.17,0:17:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Your twisted game is done!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.39,0:18:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,End this duel with Saber Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.55,0:18:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.67,0:18:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The door's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.59,0:18:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a valiant effort, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.31,0:18:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, your attack was in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.91,0:18:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.23,0:18:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.61,0:19:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You mind telling me why\Nwe're floating in space?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.33,0:19:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.81,0:19:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Dots.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.99,0:19:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd suggest you take us back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.27,0:19:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But we never left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.85,0:19:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What you're experiencing right now is\Nmerely a vision generated by the Oracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.55,0:19:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how the seal communicates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.81,0:19:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It shows us images of things as they\Nwere, or as they might one day be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.69,0:19:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.83,0:19:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the darkness\Nthat has always existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.11,0:19:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to\Nprove with all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.63,0:19:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That human beings spend every second of\Ntheir lives surrounded by dark energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.55,0:19:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It has contaminated our entire planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.77,0:19:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, at the core of everyone's\Nheart, you'll find pure darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.07,0:19:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And when a human being crosses\Npaths with the Obelisk,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.79,0:19:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,the evil inside is set free.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.29,0:19:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It was on this very day,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.09,0:19:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,ten thousand years ago, that I came\Ninto contact with this powerful force.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.49,0:19:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And it opened my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.83,0:20:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean it took over\Nyour mind, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.07,0:20:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have expected such\Nignorance from you, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.81,0:20:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You choose to shut yourself\Noff from the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.59,0:20:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as my people did so long ago,\Nwhen I presided over paradise on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.49,0:20:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.25,0:20:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting a glimpse\Nof the legendary city
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.05,0:20:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,of Atlantis as it was\Nten thousand years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.45,0:20:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,when I ruled as king.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.77,0:20:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You were king?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.39,0:20:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed I was, and I shall be once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.17,0:20:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,For when I defeat you,\Nparadise shall return!
